'=====================================================================
' Agent name : BulkReg\04 - Verify Registration and Vault
' Version    : 3.6.4  (BulkReg release; libraries BulkRegCommon + BulkRegAgents 3.6.4)
' Code       : ALL logic is in the script library BulkRegAgents (BR_RunVerify).
'              This agent only calls it, so it never changes between releases.
'
' HOW TO INSTALL: open the agent, click in the editor, Ctrl+A, Delete, paste this
'              WHOLE file, Ctrl+S. Designer puts each part in its place automatically.
' Designer   : Shared agent, LotusScript
'              Runtime: On event > Action menu selection, Target: None
'              (NOT 'All selected documents' - Designer's default - or Notes asks for a selected document)
'              (backslash in the name = Actions > BulkReg submenu; do NOT use '|')
'
' What it does (details: BulkRegAgents > BR_RunVerify):
'
' Scope (asked at start):
'   a batch file  -> verifies only the Include=Y users of BATCH-<id>.csv and
'                    writes <BatchDir>\BATCH-<id>_verify_<run>.csv
'   blank         -> verifies every DirSync user (objectGUID present)
' Status per user: UNREGISTERED | REGISTERED + IN_VAULT | REGISTERED + NOT_IN_VAULT
'                  + MailFileStatus MAILFILE_OK | MAILFILE_MISSING | NO_MAILFILE_IN_PERSON_DOC
'                  | CHECK_ERROR | NOT_FOUND
'                  + ReplicaStatus REPLICAS_OK n/n | REPLICAS_MISSING k/n (missing: ...) | NONE
'                    (a replica = same replica ID on the other mail cluster member)
' Run it after each batch and before deleting local ID files.
'=====================================================================
'#####################################################################
' --- part 1: (Options) ---
'#####################################################################
Option Public
Option Declare
Use "BulkRegAgents"
'#####################################################################
' --- part 2: Initialize ---
'#####################################################################
Sub Initialize
	Call BR_RunVerify()
End Sub
